    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def maxFrequencyElements(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\r\n        cnt = Counter(nums)\r\n        mx = max(cnt.values())\r\n        return sum(x for x in cnt.values() if x == mx)",
